Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 20:26:29 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Flatten peer settings into compact native model menu rows

Reuse native model and effort rows directly in the member menu instead of nesting another picker. Match native composer typography and 28px controls, keep context on the icon tooltip, and reduce the session link to a small action. Validate shared and peer controls with 149 tests and typecheck.
